  <p>Bob Mills is a writer of speculative fiction, exploring the intersection of human resilience and technological progress. With a background in engineering and a passion for space exploration, Bob Mills brings scientific accuracy and emotional depth to stories about humanity's future beyond Earth. The Lunar Foundation series represents a years-long project to imagine, in granular detail, what the first permanent human settlement on the Moon might actually look like — not just the hardware, but the people, the politics, and the profound changes that come from living on another world.</p>
</div>

<div class="back-matter">
